{"id":"question-chinese-content-ab-2","subject":"chinese","type":"single-choice","prompt":"【114 年國中教育會考國文科第 14 題】下列文句「」中的字，何者讀音正確？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"揶揄：ㄧㄝˊ"},{"id":"B","text":"晾晒：ㄐㄧㄥ"},{"id":"C","text":"藩籬：ㄆㄢ"},{"id":"D","text":"栽了下來：ㄘㄞˊ"}],"knowledgeIds":["kg-chinese-content-ab"],"difficulty":"medium","answer":{"value":"A","explanation":"『揶揄』的『揶』讀ㄧㄝˊ；『晾』讀ㄌㄧㄤˋ、『藩』讀ㄈㄢ、『栽』讀ㄗㄞ。"},"provenance":{"origin":"official-open","license":"依法令舉行之國中教育會考試題；依著作權法第9條第1項第5款核對","sourceUrl":"https://kaonow.com/paper/cap-114-chinese/","sourceLocator":"114 年國中教育會考國文科第 14 題；頁面列示官方答案 A"},"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-08-28","lessonId":"lesson-chinese-content-ab"}
